graph LR
    subgraph DFD_Level_0 ["Level 0: Context Data Flow"]
        Dev[User / Software Developer] -->|1. Python Workspace / Source Archive| SM[SentinelMesh Framework]
        SM -->|2. Health Metrics, Bug Reports, Patch Diffs| Dev
    end

    subgraph DFD_Level_1 ["Level 1: Subsystem Data Flow"]
        Src[(Source Files)] --> Parse[AST Parser & Lint Engine]
        Parse --> FileRisk[(file_risks)]
        
        Src --> Synth[Test Generator Engine]
        Synth --> Tests[(sentinel_tests/)]
        
        Tests --> Exec[Sandbox Pytest Runner]
        Src --> Exec
        Exec --> CovJson[coverage.json & Pytest XML]
        
        CovJson --> BugClass[Bug Classifier]
        FileRisk --> BugClass
        BugClass --> BugTable[(bugs DB Table)]
        
        BugTable --> RCA[Root Cause Analyzer]
        Src --> RCA
        RCA --> Slices[AST Code Slices & Chains]
        
        Slices --> Fixer[Auto-Fix Engine]
        Fixer --> SandboxVerify[Isolated Pre-flight Sandbox]
        SandboxVerify --> Patches[(Verified Patches)]
        
        Patches --> Critic[Critic Agent Consensus]
        Critic --> ConsensusScore[Debate Records]
        
        ConsensusScore --> MutEngine[AST Mutation Tester]
        MutEngine --> MutScore[(mutation_records)]
        
        MutScore --> RepAgent[Report Generator Agent]
        BugTable --> RepAgent
        RepAgent --> FinalRep[Markdown & Exec Summary]
    end
